<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0383_R33_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rain always starts right about\nhere, like the sky’s marking the\fborder.\rAzalea’s just through the trees.\nQuiet town. Good town.\r...Been a strange few days down\nthere, though, from what I hear.\rYou’re headed in anyway?\nMind yourself.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0383_R33_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rt. 33\nWest to Azalea Town</language>
	</row>
</body>
